    {
        "id":"brute_fisherman_30",
        "message":"Ohh! Do not keep me in suspense.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"I have discovered a cave where those brutes swarming the shores pour out of.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_fisherman_32"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_fisherman_40",
        "message":"Finally! Something interesting on this idyllic day, what's in the cave?",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"All the brutes along the coast actually come from this cave.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_fisherman_41"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_fisherman_42",
        "message":"But how can that be?",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"I talked to this eccentric guy named Os. He claims to be a researcher who turns rats into these brutes to study them.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_fisherman_44"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_fisherman_44",
        "message":"Really? I hardly believe that is possible.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"I don't understand how he does it exactly, but the rats turn into these brutes throughout several stages.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_fisherman_46"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_fisherman_46",
        "message":"Stages? What do you mean?",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"There are several bake rooms the rats pass through, and each time take on an even more hideous appearance. Until they finally come out of the cave as brutes.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_fisherman_50"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_fisherman_90",
        "message":"Now I know where these brutes suddenly came from.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"N",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_fisherman_92"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_fisherman_94",
        "message":"... and won't believe a word I say.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"Who could imagine those furry brutes start off as tiny little rats.",
                "nextPhraseID":"X"
            },
            {
                "text":"Regrettable, I found it quite interesting myself.",
                "nextPhraseID":"X"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_10",
        "message":"Here in the laboratory you can see my latest research on brutes.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"You are researching brutes?",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_20"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_extra",
        "message":"Yes, many colleagues. The ignorant people in charge have no passion for advancing the fields of knowledge.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"N",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_10"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_2",
        "message":"You certainly want to know everything about these brutes outside.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"Do I?",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_10"
            },
            {
                "text":"Well, if you say so ...",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_10"
            },
            {
                "text":"Maybe. I find them quite fascinating.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_4"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_4",
        "message":"Indeed. And you are talking to the only expert in these matters who is still alive.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"There were more like you?",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_extra"
            },
            {
                "text":"These 'matters' tend to run around and get in my way.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_6"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_20",
        "message":"Researching? Well, no. I am far ahead already.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"N",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_22"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_32",
        "message":"This was a triumph, a huge success!",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"I'll let you continue playing with your brutes.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_40"
            },
            {
                "text":"Thank you for telling me all this.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_40"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_40",
        "message":"Now I have to work again.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"Sounds like fun.",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_42"
            },
            {
                "text":"Be glad. May I visit your laboratory?",
                "nextPhraseID":"brute_creator_42"
            }
        ]
    },
    {
        "id":"brute_creator_42",
        "message":"You're welcome to look around a little. But don't enter the Brute Bake rooms.",
        "replies":[
            {
                "text":"I don't want to turn into a brute.",
                "nextPhraseID":"X"
            },
            {
                "text":"Sure, I want to stay alive after all.",
                "nextPhraseID":"X"
            }
        ]
    }
]